<p>We think of light speed as dizzyingly fast, but it&#8217;s still disastrously slow given the roomy universe we find ourselves in. NASA astronomer James O&#8217;Donoghue designed these videos to illustrate. If we could bend it around Earth, light would orbit the planet in 0.13 seconds:</p>
